resources.string:
Android does not let apps request this permission themselves, so you need to enable it manually:
1. Tap Open settings to open the system overlay management page;
2. Find Task Manager and turn on that switch;
3. Come back to this page: the setting completes automatically, and the floating window appears after you restart the app.

Android does not let apps grant this permission themselves, so you need to enable it manually:
1. Tap Open settings to open the system accessibility page;
2. Find Task Manager and turn its service on;
3. Come back to this page: the setting completes automatically.
